B2 the fence as a map from SRE's property lattice (sre-core.rkt:246-260) to {free < fenced}
  order (a ⊑ b iff a ⊔ b = b):
    prop-unknown ⊑ prop-confirmed
    prop-unknown ⊑ prop-refuted
    prop-unknown ⊑ prop-contradicted
    prop-confirmed ⊑ prop-contradicted
    prop-refuted ⊑ prop-contradicted
  unknown ⊔ refuted = prop-refuted   (an UNDECLARED merge whose sample fails is refuted, not contradicted)
  monotone maps: 6 of 16
  monotone with confirmed↦free, contradicted↦fenced: 2
    ((prop-unknown free) (prop-confirmed free) (prop-refuted free) (prop-contradicted fenced))
    ((prop-unknown free) (prop-confirmed free) (prop-refuted fenced) (prop-contradicted fenced))
  ... of which fail-closed (unknown↦fenced): 0
  D.2 literal "contradicted ⇒ fenced": monotone? #t ; refuted ↦ free ; unknown ↦ free
  POWER: fail-closed map (fenced unless confirmed) monotone? #f

